{title: Holy, Holy, Holy}
{artist: Reginald Heber}
{key: D}
{youtube: https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Holy+Holy+Holy+hymn}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Holy, holy, [G]holy! [D]Lord God Al[A]mighty!
[D]Early in the [Bm]morning our [Em]song shall rise to [A7]Thee
[D]Holy, holy, [G]holy, [D]merciful and [A]mighty!
[G]God in three [D]Persons, [A]blessed [D]Trinity
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Holy, holy, [G]holy! [D]All the saints a[A]dore Thee
[D]Casting down their [Bm]golden crowns a[Em]round the glassy [A]sea
[D]Cherubim and [G]seraphim [D]falling down be[A]fore Thee
[G]Who was and [D]is and [A]ever[D]more shall be
{end_of_verse}
